{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"视线第一下落在左上方两行大号白色标题，随后容易被下方紫色放大的“少露些心意，会不会少疼些？”吸引。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"能看出他很喜欢和对方相处，想确认这份关系能否一直持续；具体正面临怎样的情感两难，第一眼不确定。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"甜蜜、期待中夹着不安、害怕失去。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他起初害怕自己的需要给对方添负担，如今更害怕对方不再需要自己；想收起心意减少受伤，却发现压抑真心反而更难受。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上方长标题和下方大号粗体段落都很显眼，争夺主视线。\",\n    \"单块文字都较长，包含多层转折和递进，尤其下方段落需要读完整才能理解两难。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在上下两块：上方讲关系的不确定，下方讲害怕不被需要以及压抑心意的痛苦，需要拼接。\",\n    \"紫色放大的“少露些心意，会不会少疼些？”虽然醒目，但单独不能说明他为什么想收起心意。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3c12001b-114a-4005-a99a-392b015deb29", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T011746946828Z", "elapsed_seconds": 51.813, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:18:38.748229+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "64a7429ca3fcd9fe38edbdf60d5c693823965a2e87d43c6f83e2f49e4a227e3d", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed